. * logit gives the identical saturated-case decisions on the same seed
. powerape dgp dl, model(logit) focal(t, binary p(0.5)) baseline(0.30) nodispla
> y

. powerape setape dl, target(0.10) nodisplay

. powerape power dl, n(500) claim(detect) nsim(2000) seed(11) engine(mata) nodi
> splay nodraws

. local pl = r(power)

. powerape power d10, n(500) claim(detect) nsim(2000) seed(11) engine(mata) nod
> isplay nodraws

. mata: reca("probit = logit, saturated case, same seed", `pl', st_numscalar("r
> (power)"), 1e12)

